# Famly 🏡 Environment Configuration

# Optional Supabase Connection (For Multi-Device Cloud Sync & Real Photo Storage)
# If provided, Famly automatically enables live database sync across devices and uploads photos to Supabase Storage.
# If omitted, Famly functions in local / offline mode using browser localStorage.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
